      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  请把桌面上这三个文件夹安装到当前项目，都配置成项目级 Skill，装好后验证可触发：\n  - ~/Desktop/test-routing-advisor\n  - ~/Desktop/testing-system-blueprint\n  - ~/Desktop/backend-testing\n  - ~/Desktop/frontend-testing\n  - ~/Desktop/fullstack-slice-testing\n  - ~/Desktop/full-chain-testing\n\n  注意：项目级安装，不要装到全局、不要影响我其它项目。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rEUIOtBjZoSokvu8Rsn5E",
      "originalText": "  请把桌面上这三个文件夹安装到当前项目，都配置成项目级 Skill，装好后验证可触发：\n  - ~/Desktop/test-routing-advisor\n  - ~/Desktop/testing-system-blueprint\n  - ~/Desktop/backend-testing\n  - ~/Desktop/frontend-testing\n  - ~/Desktop/fullstack-slice-testing\n  - ~/Desktop/full-chain-testing\n\n  注意：项目级安装，不要装到全局、不要影响我其它项目。",
