      "locked": false,
      "text": "现在开始实现 specs/00X-dockerize-and-deploy/。开 worktree(claude --worktree\n  feat-00X-dockerize-and-deploy),依次执行 tasks.md 的每个 task,严格走\n  superpowers:test-driven-development(RED→GREEN→REFACTOR),每个 task 完成\n后更新 state.md\n  把当前任务从 [>] 改 [x] 再进下一个,中间不要停。全部 task 绿后停下来等我审,再走\n§11\n  收尾三步(code review → finishing → 复盘追加 LEARNINGS)。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "OU_FOSki1SXDFAd-cqiTT",
      "originalText": "现在开始实现 specs/00X-dockerize-and-deploy/。开 worktree(claude --worktree\n  feat-00X-dockerize-and-deploy),依次执行 tasks.md 的每个 task,严格走\n  superpowers:test-driven-development(RED→GREEN→REFACTOR),每个 task 完成后更新 state.md\n  把当前任务从 [>] 改 [x] 再进下一个,中间不要停。全部 task 绿后停下来等我审,再走 §11\n  收尾三步(code review → finishing → 复盘追加 LEARNINGS)。",
