      "y": 13865.022114861888,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "· 单个 feature 开发完就测(L2)，缺陷就地定位、反馈最快\n· 集成测试绑在【feature 边界】\n· 官方工具天然支持：Spec-Kit per-story Checkpoint、\n   Superpowers verification-before-completion / finishing-a-development-branch\n   都按 task / feature 触发",
      "originalText": "· 单个 feature 开发完就测(L2)，缺陷就地定位、反馈最快\n· 集成测试绑在【feature 边界】\n· 官方工具天然支持：Spec-Kit per-story Checkpoint、\n   Superpowers verification-before-completion / finishing-a-development-branch\n   都按 task / feature 触发",
