    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pLf5NsW0BDqlCV8K15SBs",
      "x": -4794.4884179443525,
      "y": 15858.923789047527,
      "width": 695.4195556640625,
      "height": 99,
      "text": "\n多栈示例（示意，非写死，由 backend-testing 按栈选型）：\n  真库 / 迁移  → Py: testcontainers / pytest-postgresql + pytest-alembic ｜ Node: testcontainers-node\n              ｜ Go: dockertest + golang-migrate ｜ JVM: Testcontainers + Flyway\n  并发  → pytest-run-parallel ｜ Promise.all ｜ goroutine + -race      韧性  → respx · pytest-httpx ｜ nock · msw ｜ WireMock\n  越权 BOLA/BFLA → 框架无关自建模式（双身份 token + 参数化 + 断言拒绝）；开源无即用、可选商用 StackHawk / hadrian",
      "originalText": "\n多栈示例（示意，非写死，由 backend-testing 按栈选型）：\n  真库 / 迁移  → Py: testcontainers / pytest-postgresql + pytest-alembic ｜ Node: testcontainers-node\n              ｜ Go: dockertest + golang-migrate ｜ JVM: Testcontainers + Flyway\n  并发  → pytest-run-parallel ｜ Promise.all ｜ goroutine + -race      韧性  → respx · pytest-httpx ｜ nock · msw ｜ WireMock\n  越权 BOLA/BFLA → 框架无关自建模式（双身份 token + 参数化 + 断言拒绝）；开源无即用、可选商用 StackHawk / hadrian",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
