    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "FN0_mtW9FNx8_4vGafGn_",
      "x": -527.4396837301301,
      "y": 15429.900010468096,
      "width": 231.68597412109375,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "每个模块单独测都通过了，可是\n『用户走完一条跨多功能的完整流程』\n——这条完整链路从没被整体验过一次。",
      "originalText": "每个模块单独测都通过了，可是\n『用户走完一条跨多功能的完整流程』\n——这条完整链路从没被整体验过一次。",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
