    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "0XFnsDR9pfe62gfhLuF0G",
      "x": -520.6740587301301,
      "y": 15937.724229218096,
      "width": 1190,
      "height": 24,
      "text": "完整链路几乎全是『解耦边』：跨服务 HTTP / 定时 / 异步 / 跨渠道——它们靠共享标识符（URL、消息主题、任务名、共享数据键）连接，不是函数调用。",
      "originalText": "完整链路几乎全是『解耦边』：跨服务 HTTP / 定时 / 异步 / 跨渠道——它们靠共享标识符（URL、消息主题、任务名、共享数据键）连接，不是函数调用。",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 244572765,
      "version": 627,
      "versionNonce": 1099307197,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [
        "xBfIkB-qjnR9nEIhhIMyX",
        "HAVdLUWHonUKlWawkiTN_",
        "xaxb5KA_vJHD2KGTpQb-w"
      ],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "frameId": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "roundness": null,
